# Goal / Progress (new)

Purpose: a metric with a finish line — current value vs target,
rendered as progress. Exists because a bare number carries no
judgment; "$1.2M" only means something against "goal: $2M by Q3".
Turns dashboards from mirrors into scoreboards.

| Option | Category | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| size / position | layout | x,y,w,h (default 3x3) | |
| variant | layout | bar / ring / number + % | |
| title | display | text (default "Goal") | |
| icon | display | icon name / none | |
| metric | data | agg (count/sum/avg) + field | same engine as Metric |
| target | data | manual number | field-driven later |
| direction | data | reach >= target / stay <= target | budget vs quota |
| period | data | all-time / month / quarter / custom range | resets progress window |
| percent | display | on / off | |
| remaining | display | off / absolute ("$760k to go") | |
| pace | display | off / on-track indicator | vs linear time elapsed |
| color thresholds | display | auto (red<50%, green>=100%) / custom | |
| concept | filter | conceptId | |
| conditions | filter | SidebarCondition[] | |
| match | filter | all / any | |
